{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_071_x2ct_gan-title\">X2CT-GAN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">双正交 2D 编码器将特征提升并融合到 3D，再以体素重建和 3D adversarial loss 联合监督。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Lifts features from two orthogonal (bi-planar PA + lateral) 2D chest X-rays into 3D via backprojection-inspired feature expansion and cross-view fusion supervised by 3D voxel + GAN losses.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">正位与侧位两幅正交 X-ray</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pair of orthogonal posterior–anterior (PA) and lateral 2D chest radiographs</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">端到端生成的 3D CT 体</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Synthesized 3D volumetric chest CT tensor</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2019/html/Ying_X2CT-GAN_Reconstructing_CT_From_Biplanar_X-Rays_With_Generative_Adversarial_Networks_CVPR_2019_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"X2CT-GAN original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/1c22c7b08117f5647659.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">双平面 X-ray</span><span class=\"lang-en\">X-ray</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">两幅近正交投影提供互补但仍不充分的 3D 信息</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of orthogonal posterior–anterior (pa) and lateral 2d chest radiographs and prepares initial tensor representations (X-ray).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"两幅近正交投影提供互补但仍不充分的 3D 信息\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests pair of orthogonal posterior–anterior (pa) and lateral 2d chest radiographs and prepares initial tensor representations (X-ray).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"双平面 X-ray\" data-node-name-en=\"X-ray\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双平面 X-ray</span><span class=\"lang-en\">X-ray</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两幅近正交投影提供互补但仍不充分的 3D 信息</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests pair of orthogonal posterior–anterior (pa) and lateral 2d chest radiographs and prepares initial tensor representations (X-ray).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各视图独立提取多尺度投影特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 2D encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"双 2D 编码器\" data-node-name-en=\"2D encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双 2D 编码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各视图独立提取多尺度投影特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 2D encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将视图特征 reshape/扩展到体素特征块\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D→3D within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"2D→3D 提升\" data-node-name-en=\"2D→3D\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 提升</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D→3D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将视图特征 reshape/扩展到体素特征块</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D→3D within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在共享 3D 坐标中拼接或融合两方向特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs fusion within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"跨视图融合\" data-node-name-en=\"fusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">跨视图融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在共享 3D 坐标中拼接或融合两方向特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs fusion within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3D 上采样/卷积逐级生成完整体积\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D decoder within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3D 解码器\" data-node-name-en=\"3D decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 解码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3D 上采样/卷积逐级生成完整体积</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D decoder within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"体素强度输出 x_hat\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prediction CT within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"预测 CT\" data-node-name-en=\"prediction CT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预测 CT</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prediction CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体素强度输出 x_hat</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prediction CT within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"MSE/L1 等与配对真实 CT 比较，约束患者级内容\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs voxel reconstruction loss within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"体素重建损失\" data-node-name-en=\"voxel reconstruction loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">体素重建损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">voxel reconstruction loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MSE/L1 等与配对真实 CT 比较，约束患者级内容</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs voxel reconstruction loss within the core biplanar 2d to 3d gan computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对抗损失推动局部体纹理接近真实 CT 分布\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies 3D discriminator to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"3D 判别器\" data-node-name-en=\"3D discriminator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 判别器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D discriminator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对抗损失推动局部体纹理接近真实 CT 分布</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies 3D discriminator to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合重建与 adversarial supervision 的生成结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces synthesized 3d volumetric chest ct tensor via 3D CT.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"3D CT\" data-node-name-en=\"3D CT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_071_x2ct_gan', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合重建与 adversarial supervision 的生成结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces synthesized 3d volumetric chest ct tensor via 3D CT.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"X2CT-GAN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 双视图特征提升与 3D 对抗重建</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Bi-Planar 2D-to-3D Feature Lifting, Orthogonal Fusion &amp; 3D Adversarial Reconstruction</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"X2CT-GAN：核心公式 · 双视图特征提升与 3D 对抗重建\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"71\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.038701pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1