4276\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-188\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"110.14959\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-186\" y=\"-60.002514\"></use><use x=\"115.625545\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g10-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"130.048077\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-76\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"137.745703\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g7-28\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"147.37115\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"156.972852\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"164.302846\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g17-94\" y=\"-62.014972\"></use><use x=\"162.003987\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g10-45\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"171.087082\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-0\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"180.185132\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g10-45\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"187.552496\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"192.035682\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g14-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"192.035682\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g14-50\" y=\"-56.961428\"></use><use x=\"198.384037\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-184\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"206.804629\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g10-95\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"212.5182\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g4-76\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"220.179462\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g14-71\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"225.248545\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g14-65\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"230.499457\" xlink:href=\"#m071_g14-78\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">2D 投影到 3D 体积高度欠定，早期方法缺统一端到端表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructing a 3D volume from 1–2 planar X-ray projections is severely ill-posed, and standard 2D networks lack a 3D spatial bottleneck.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">将双正交 X-ray 的 2D 特征 reshape/fuse 为 3D CT，并联合 MSE 与 adversarial loss</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Encode PA and lateral radiographs via parallel 2D DenseNet-like encoders, expand 2D feature maps along the orthogonal depth axes, and fuse them inside a 3D decoder.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">双视图 encoder、2D-to-3D generation 与跨视图 feature fusion</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">View-specific 2D-to-3D feature liftingconnections + bi-planar orthogonal fusion + 3D PatchGAN + projection consistency losses.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定深度 2D-to-3D CT 生成的历史基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Canonical baseline for bi-planar 2D X-ray to 3D CT volumetric lifting.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要但不唯一；逼真纹理不等于患者真实 anatomy</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historically important 2D-to-3D baseline; must never be treated as a diagnostic replacement for true CT acquisition due to null-space hallucination.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">双视图分别编码后在 3D 特征空间融合，比单视图提供更多深度约束，但问题仍高度欠定。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">2D-to-3D feature lifting 让 generator 可直接输出体素网格，而非逐切片预测。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">体素损失约束配对内容，对抗损失改善分布外观；后者可能以逼真纹理掩盖患者级错误。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Encode PA and lateral radiographs via parallel 2D DenseNet-like encoders, expand 2D feature maps along the orthogonal depth axes, and fuse them inside a 3D decoder.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: View-specific 2D-to-3D feature liftingconnections + bi-planar orthogonal fusion + 3D PatchGAN + projection consistency losses.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Bi-Planar 2D-to-3D Feature Lifting, Orthogonal Fusion &amp; 3D Adversarial Reconstruction.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可作为低投影视图到 3D CT 生成研究的历史基线，适合探索粗解剖和规划先验。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">没有显式 Beer–Lambert forward consistency 或不确定性时，不应把生成体当作真实诊断 CT 或定量 HU。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Canonical baseline for bi-planar 2D X-ray to 3D CT volumetric lifting.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historically important 2D-to-3D baseline; must never be treated as a diagnostic replacement for true CT acquisition due to null-space hallucination.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_CVPR_2019/html/Ying_X2CT-GAN_Reconstructing_CT_From_Biplanar_X-Rays_With_Generative_Adversarial_Networks_CVPR_2019_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>X2CT-GAN: Reconstructing CT from Biplanar X-Rays with Generative Adversarial Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kylekma/X2CT\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
